ontribute. File size does not establish resident host RAM or VRAM. Calibration is intended to reduce low-bit quality loss; that benefit must be measured against the controls. Do not claim throughput improvement, memory residency savings, acceptable quality for all variants, or an imatrix quality improvement without completed corresponding lab results. A WikiText CPU sanity KLD, if present, supports only that model and dataset, not task-level quality.\nEOF\n tail -6 artifacts/codexPAP/logs/imatrix.log\n date -u'","aggregated_output":"0.00.548.890 I system_info: n_threads = 6 (n_threads_batch = 6) / 16 | CPU : SSE3 = 1 | SSSE3 = 1 | AVX = 1 | AVX2 = 1 | F16C = 1 | FMA = 1 | BMI2 = 1 | LLAMAFILE = 1 | OPENMP = 1 | REPACK = 1 | \n0.00.548.895 I compute_imatrix: tokenizing the input ..\n0.05.509.192 I compute_imatrix: tokenization took 4960.29 ms\n0.05.509.219 I compute_imatrix: computing over 100 chunks, n_ctx=512, batch_size=2048, n_seq=4\n0.17.205.435 I compute_imatrix: 11.70 seconds per pass - ETA 4.87 minutes\n\nMon Nov  9 23:09:23 UTC 2026\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
